{"seq":1,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》其文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"通信的数学理论-其文\">《通信的数学理论》其文</h1><p>《通信的数学理论》（A Mathematical Theory of Communication）发表于一九四八年的《贝尔系统技术期刊》（Bell System Technical Journal）第二十七卷：上篇见七月号第 379–423 页，下篇见十月号第 623–656 页（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Mathematical_Theory_of_Communication\">Wikipedia: A Mathematical Theory of Communication</a>）。这篇分两期连载的长文几乎独力创立了信息论，论文首页第一次把「比特」（bit，binary digit 的缩写，香农归功于同事图基 J. W. Tukey）引入科学文献。本篇逐节拆解全文的论证骨架与核心结果；这些结果在兄弟篇 <a href=\"a-landmark-paper\">一篇里程碑式的论文</a> 中从「影响史」角度评价，此处只讲「论文写了什么、为什么对」，两篇不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这篇论文的论证骨架可以用三件东西概括：<strong>一个模型</strong>（信源→编码→信道→解码→信宿，噪声注入信道）、<strong>一个度量</strong>（熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，从连续性、单调性、可分解性三公理唯一导出）、<strong>两条定理</strong>（无噪下的信源编码定理定出压缩下界，有噪下的信道编码定理定出可靠传输上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）。全篇最关键的取舍是开头那一刀：把<strong>语义</strong>（消息对人是否有意义）与<strong>工程</strong>（比特能否可靠送达）彻底切开——正是斩断语义，才让通信第一次能用纯数学度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通信系统的一般模型\">通信系统的一般模型</h2><p>香农开篇做了一件后来被反复引用的事：把任意通信系统抽象成一条单向链路，而非针对电报、电话各立一套理论。模型由五个部件组成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S[信源&lt;br/&gt;information source] --&gt; T[发射器/编码器&lt;br/&gt;transmitter]&#10;  T --&gt;|信号| C[信道&lt;br/&gt;channel]&#10;  N[噪声源&lt;br/&gt;noise source] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|接收信号| R[接收器/解码器&lt;br/&gt;receiver]&#10;  R --&gt; D[信宿&lt;br/&gt;destination]\">flowchart LR\n  S[信源&lt;br/&gt;information source] --&gt; T[发射器/编码器&lt;br/&gt;transmitter]\n  T --&gt;|信号| C[信道&lt;br/&gt;channel]\n  N[噪声源&lt;br/&gt;noise source] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|接收信号| R[接收器/解码器&lt;br/&gt;receiver]\n  R --&gt; D[信宿&lt;br/&gt;destination]</pre><p>这个模型的关键 why 在于「分层」：它把<strong>语义</strong>（消息对人是否有意义）与<strong>工程</strong>（比特能否可靠送达）彻底切开。香农在引言里直言「通信的语义问题与工程问题无关」（the semantic aspects of communication are irrelevant to the engineering problem）。正是这一刀斩断语义，才让通信第一次能用纯数学度量——这是全篇最反直觉、也最有生产力的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信息的度量-熵\">信息的度量：熵</h2><p>香农要给「信源产生多少信息」一个数。他从一组公理出发（连续性、单调性、可分解性），证明唯一满足条件的度量（至多差一个常数）就是熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>单位：比特/符号</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = -\\sum_{i} p_i \\log_2 p_i \\quad(\\text{单位：比特/符号})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位：比特</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">符号</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信源</th>\n<th>分布</th>\n<th>熵 H</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公平硬币</td>\n<td>(0.5, 0.5)</td>\n<td>1 比特</td>\n<td>每次抛掷恰好 1 比特不确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏置硬币</td>\n<td>(0.9, 0.1)</td>\n<td>≈0.469 比特</td>\n<td>偏置越大，信息越少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定事件</td>\n<td>(1, 0)</td>\n<td>0 比特</td>\n<td>已知结果，无信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英文字母（近似）</td>\n<td>27 符号</td>\n<td>≈4.0→1–2 比特</td>\n<td>计入上下文冗余后大幅下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>熵同时是「压缩的下界」与「不确定性的度量」。香农借英文统计估算其熵远低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>27</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>4.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 27 \\approx 4.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.76</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，揭示自然语言含大量冗余——这正是后世数据压缩的理论起点。熵在思想方法层面的展开见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无噪信道与信源编码定理\">无噪信道与信源编码定理</h2><p>香农先处理理想情形：信道无噪声。<strong>信源编码定理</strong>（第一定理）说：要无失真表示一个熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的信源，平均每符号至少需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，且存在编码可任意逼近此下界。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>意义</strong>：压缩有不可逾越的硬底，喊「无损压缩到任意小」是反模式——违反热力学第二定律式的信息守恒。</li>\n<li><strong>构造</strong>：香农给出香农–法诺式前缀码雏形，霍夫曼（David Huffman）一九五二年给出最优算法。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡</strong>：逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的代价是更长的分组与更大的编解码延迟，工程上须在码率与时延间取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"有噪信道与信道编码定理\">有噪信道与信道编码定理</h2><p>这是全文皇冠上的明珠。直觉认为：信道有噪声，要降低错误率就只能不断降低传输速率，趋于零。香农<strong>信道编码定理</strong>（第二定理）颠覆了这一直觉：每条信道有一个容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，只要传输速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，就存在编码使错误概率任意小；而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &gt; C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 时错误无法避免。</p>\n<p>对带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的连续信道，容量由著名的香农–哈特利公式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>比特/秒</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = B \\log_2\\!\\left(1 + \\frac{S}{N}\\right)\\quad(\\text{比特/秒})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[速率 R] --&gt;|R &lt; C| OK[错误率可→0&lt;br/&gt;存在好码]&#10;  A --&gt;|R = C| LIMIT[临界 - 香农极限]&#10;  A --&gt;|R &gt; C| FAIL[错误率有正下界&lt;br/&gt;无论如何编码]\">flowchart LR\n  A[速率 R] --&gt;|R &lt; C| OK[错误率可→0&lt;br/&gt;存在好码]\n  A --&gt;|R = C| LIMIT[临界 - 香农极限]\n  A --&gt;|R &gt; C| FAIL[错误率有正下界&lt;br/&gt;无论如何编码]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信道容量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可靠传输的速率上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互信息</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(X;Y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>接收端获知发送端的信息量；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\max I(X;Y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>香农极限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.59</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_b/N_0\\ge -1.59\\text{ dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1.59</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>任何编码方案的能量效率下界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条定理的深刻在于它是<strong>存在性</strong>证明——香农用「随机编码 + 联合典型集」论证好码存在，却没给出构造。这埋下了一道延续半世纪的工程缺口：如何造出逼近香农极限的实用码（见下）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何是-奠基-而非-又一篇好论文\">为何是「奠基」而非「又一篇好论文」</h2><p>把这篇论文与同时代成果对照，更能看清它的奠基性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>此前（如奈奎斯特、哈特利）</th>\n<th>香农 1948</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息度量</td>\n<td>直觉的、与符号数挂钩</td>\n<td>公理化的熵，与概率分布挂钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声</td>\n<td>视为不可逾越的障碍</td>\n<td>可被编码「驯服」，给出容量阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>速率与可靠性此消彼长</td>\n<td>阈值以下二者可兼得</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>why 它影响深远</strong>：它给了工程师一个<strong>北极星</strong>——香农极限。此后通信工程的历史几乎就是「逼近香农极限」的历史：里德–所罗门码、卷积码、一九九三年的 Turbo 码、以及一九六〇年代提出、二〇〇〇年代复兴的 LDPC 码（现用于 5G、Wi-Fi 6），都在向这条线逼近。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误读（反模式）</strong>：把熵当成「混乱程度」的文学比喻而忽略其精确定义；或以为信道编码定理给出了具体的码——它只保证存在。这两点是初学者最易踩的坑。</li>\n<li><strong>原创综合</strong>：香农的真正天才不在某个公式，而在把「语义无关」「概率信源」「容量阈值」三件事缝成一个自洽体系，使「信息」从工程口语变为可计算的物理量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>论文的骨架是三件东西：通用通信模型、公理化的熵、两条极限定理。</li>\n<li>开篇「语义与工程无关」的一刀，是全篇最有生产力的取舍，也是它普适的根源。</li>\n<li>信源编码定理给出压缩下界（无损压缩到任意小是反模式）；信道编码定理给出容量阈值。</li>\n<li>信道编码定理是<strong>存在性</strong>证明，不给出具体构造，这埋下了半个世纪的工程缺口。</li>\n<li>反模式：把熵当「混乱程度」的文学比喻，或以为定理给出了可直接使用的码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸与交叉\">延伸与交叉</h2><ul>\n<li>论文的历史地位与跨领域辐射：本章 <a href=\"a-landmark-paper\">一篇里程碑式的论文</a></li>\n<li>香农把同一套信息论方法迁移到密码学：<a href=\"../other-works/cryptography-and-secrecy\">密码学与保密</a></li>\n<li>信息论在香农整体贡献中的位置：兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></li>\n<li>熵、互信息等概念的方法论：兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>关键事实来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Mathematical_Theory_of_Communication\">Wikipedia: A Mathematical Theory of Communication</a>；卷期页码另见 <a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/j.1538-7305.1948.tb01338.x\">Wiley Online Library, BSTJ 1948</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"《通信的数学理论》其文","id":"通信的数学理论-其文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"通信系统的一般模型","id":"通信系统的一般模型"},{"level":2,"text":"信息的度量：熵","id":"信息的度量-熵"},{"level":2,"text":"无噪信道与信源编码定理","id":"无噪信道与信源编码定理"},{"level":2,"text":"有噪信道与信道编码定理","id":"有噪信道与信道编码定理"},{"level":2,"text":"为何是「奠基」而非「又一篇好论文」","id":"为何是-奠基-而非-又一篇好论文"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸与交叉","id":"延伸与交叉"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"一篇里程碑式的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-landmark-paper"}}